    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      404.77,
      286.55,
      496.98
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act. No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      496.75,
      286.52,
      628.2
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or servitude to be Acquired: The Allotment of known as ELLAGAWA KUMBURA and shown as Lot 467 Sheet Number 18 and Supplement Number 16 (01 block) of land in total extent of about 0.0049 hectare F.V.P. 245 situated Wewelkandura Village and Wewelkandura Grama Niladhari Division in Medapattu of Kukulu Korale in Kalawana Divisional Secretariat Division of Ratnapura District, Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
