      305.22,
      362.0,
      540.61,
      400.92
    ],
    "text": "Name of Land: Ellagawa Kumbura; Claimant\u2019s Name and Address: D. W. Pathmini Witharana, Wewelkandura, Kalawana; Extent: 0.0049 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.22,
      401.35,
      543.04,
      573.42
    ],
    "text": "\u201cLand Acquisition for the conservation, of the New Bridge near Bridge No. 29/8 on Thiriwanaketiya - Agalawatta Road\u201d Ellagawa Kumbura in all persons interested in below aforesaid lands on which is servitude is to be Acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents dully authorized with documents in writing meet me on 24th, June 2015 at 10.00 a.m. at Kalawana Divisional Secretariat and are hereby required to notify to me in writing (with 2 duplicates) on or before me on 17th of June,2015 and nature of their interests in the land, the particular of their claims for compensation for the Acquisition of the said lands servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the calculation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
